3. Distribution Rights and Revenue Threshold

3.1 Internal Use. Internal Use is permitted for any Licensee at any revenue
level.

3.2 Distribution under the Threshold. Licensee may Distribute artifacts built
using Stasis only if Licensee's Gross Revenue for the current calendar year is
less than or equal to USD $10,000.

3.3 Distribution over the Threshold. If Licensee's Gross Revenue for the
current calendar year exceeds USD $10,000, Licensee must obtain a separate
commercial license from Maddox Labs LLC before any Distribution. See
COMMERCIAL_LICENSE.md.

